# Source is LF in every checkout. Windows machines commonly run git with core.autocrlf=true, and a
# CRLF working tree broke the tools suite (vitest could not parse the CRLF .mjs) and the fixture
# comparisons that pin exact bytes; the app itself preserves whatever line endings a note has.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.tgz binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
